0..76 Comment "// The cancellation subject\'s shared declarations, written once and imported"
77..153 Comment "// by every source that reads them (`import \"./cancel-base.gandr\";`): a task"
154..228 Comment "// hands its parent what it found over its end. A cancellation point is an"
229..304 Comment "// operation a capability scope answers; its clause resumes the rest of the"
305..381 Comment "// scope once or abandons it, and an abandoned end is cancelled for its peer"
382..443 Comment "// (Fowler, Lindley, Morris and Decova, doi:10.1145/3290341)."
445..521 Comment "/// A task: the protocol its end carries back to the parent, and the path it"
522..532 Comment "/// reads."
